BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🎬 哥斯拉-0.0 (Godzilla Minus Zero)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTSTAMP:20261128T103342Z
UID:movie-1381071@sg-events-calendar
CATEGORIES:Movies,Singapore
DESCRIPTION:Genres: Horror\, Action\, Sci-Fi\n\n人类的罪与罚。已
 经，没法归零。战争将日本粉碎至“零”，哥斯拉的袭
 击更将它推至“负”的绝境。时间来到两年后，人民历
 尽痛苦磨难仍坚持复苏的步伐，看似终于可以回归正常
 生活……然而此时，巨兽再次袭来。它彻底摧毁这份希
 望，将人类推向新的绝望深渊！\n\nTMDB: https://www.themoviedb
 .org/movie/1381071
IMAGE;DISPLAY=THUMBNAIL;VALUE=URI:https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/51RBWzkF
 d4zEsOGg4ZIqYlNszHc.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1381071
